      <profiles>
        <profile name="Divinator-class Auspexes (Once per phase, per unit)" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="c2e7-eafe-21e3-a40e">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your Shooting phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit is selected to shoot, you can use this ability. If you do, select one visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of this unit. That unit is scanned:
■ While a unit is scanned, ranged attacks that target that unit can re-roll hit rolls of 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Haywire Mine (Once per battle, per unit)" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="5272-b7c8-e8de-d1fa">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your Shooting phase, you can select one visible enemy unit within 6&quot; of this unit and roll one D6. On a 2+:
■ That enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.
■ Or: If that enemy unit is a VEHICLE unit, that enemy unit suffers 2D3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
