    <selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="Terminator Assault Squad" hidden="false" id="ae9a-10e3-8091-20">
      <comment>invuln: 4+</comment>
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="170"/>
      </costs>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Teleport Homer (Once per battle, per unit)" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="e126-4dd7-71ec-52fb">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the battle, you can set up one Teleport Homer token for this unit on the battlefield. If you do:
■ When you target this unit with the Rapid Ingress stratagem, you can use that Teleport Homer token. If you do, that use is -1 CP, but when resolving that stratagem, this unit must be set up within 3&quot; of that Teleport Homer token and not within 8&quot; of an enemy unit. That Teleport Homer token is then removed from the battlefield.
■ If an enemy unit ends a move within 1&quot; of that Teleport Homer token, that Teleport Homer token is removed from the battlefield.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Terminatus Assault" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="a277-c32c-c86d-654a">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">If this unit made a charge move this turn, this unit’s:
■ Lightning Claws weapons have **[SUSTAINED HITS 1: non-^^Monster^^/^^Vehicle^^]**.
■ Thunder Hammer weapons have **[SUSTAINED HITS 1: ^^Monster^^/^^Vehicle^^]**.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <categoryLinks>
