      <profiles>
        <profile name="Teleport Homer (Once per battle, per unit)" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="2378-55a7-34ce-284d">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the battle, you can set up one Teleport Homer token for this unit on the battlefield. If you do:
■ When you target this unit with the Rapid Ingress stratagem, you can use that Teleport Homer token. If you do, that use is -1 CP, but when resolving that stratagem, this unit must be set up within 3&quot; of that Teleport Homer token and not within 8&quot; of an enemy unit. That Teleport Homer token is then removed from the battlefield.
■ If an enemy unit ends a move within 1&quot; of that Teleport Homer token, that Teleport Homer token is removed from the battlefield.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Fury of the First" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="fe56-a10f-5d2-2e1a">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This unit’s attacks that target a unit within 9&quot; of this unit have +1 AP.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
