          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">■ This unit must start the battle in strategic reserves.
■ In your first Movement phase, this unit can make an ingress move.
■ When this unit is set up, all units embarked within this unit must make a disembark/assault disembark move, and those units must be set up more than 8&quot; away from all enemy units.</characteristic>
