          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This model can be attached to the following units:

■ Eliminator Squad
■ Incursor Squad
■ Infiltrator Squad
■ Reiver Squad
■ Scout Squad
■ Spectrus Kill Team
■ Wolf Scouts</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Librarian (psyker level 1)" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="ae86-0e27-c694-522e">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This model has the psychic abilities listed in the Psychic Abilities section.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Psychic Hood (Psychic)" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="14fb-602f-f266-c14e">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">This unit has Feel No Pain 4+ against psychic attacks.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Shrouding (psychic level 1)" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="5829-318c-382f-a0a4">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When an enemy unit targets this unit, if this unit is not battle-shocked, you can make a psychic roll for this unit by rolling one D6. If you do:
■ On a 1, this unit is battle-shocked.
■ Attacks that target this unit have -1 to hit rolls until the end of the phase.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Soul Sight (psychic level 1)" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="d88f-248f-e00d-7739">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your Shooting phase, if this unit is not battle-shocked, you can make a psychic roll for this unit by rolling one D6. If you do:
■ On a 1, this unit is battle-shocked.
■ Select one visible enemy unit. Ranged attacks that target that enemy unit have **[IGNORES COVER]**.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
