          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">In your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a move within 8&quot; of this unit, if this unit is unengaged, this unit can make a normal move of up to D3+3&quot;.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
