        <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Angelic Inheritors" hidden="false" id="dcc7-f9de-d4f2-69d0">
          <categoryLinks></categoryLinks>
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden">
              <conditions>
                <condition type="notInstanceOf" value="1" field="selections" scope="primary-catalogue" childId="4ef9-15ce-e3e6-36de" shared="true"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
            <modifier type="set" value="2" field="0d99-4ee2-7b3c-1f5a">
              <conditions>
                <condition type="atLeast" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" childId="d62d-db22-4893-4bc0" shared="true" includeChildSelections="true"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <profiles>
            <profile name="Legacy of the Angel" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="d8f2-0c87-9000-ccab">
              <comment>sim-mod: source=&quot;Legacy of the Angel (Carmine Wrath)&quot; reroll=hit1 reroll=wound1 kw=&quot;Character&quot; conditional</comment>
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">At the start of the first battle round, select two of the Angelic Legacy abilities listed below. Until the end of the battle, those Angelic Legacy abilities are active and their effects apply to all Adeptus  Astartes Character units from your army.


Sanguinary Grace: This unit is eligible to shoot and declare a charge in a turn in which it Fell Back.


Carmine Wrath: Each time a model in this unit makes an attack, re‑roll a Hit roll of 1 and re‑roll a Wound roll of 1.


Their Appointed Hour: You can re‑roll Advance and Charge rolls made for this unit.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Force Disposition" typeId="4680-63ad-ad70-1872" typeName="Force Disposition" hidden="false" id="7012-e18f-0649-0374">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Force Disposition" typeId="9145-6e6a-17b9-0a2c">Priority Assets</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Force Disposition" typeId="4680-63ad-ad70-1872" typeName="Force Disposition" hidden="false" id="2df9-a3c5-f6b2-4dc5">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Force Disposition" typeId="9145-6e6a-17b9-0a2c">Purge the Foe</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <costs>
            <cost name="DP" typeId="0d99-4ee2-7b3c-1f5a" value="3"/>
          </costs>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Legacy of the Angel" id="fe54-db84-ea4e-a5be" hidden="false">
              <comment>sim-mod: source=&quot;Legacy of the Angel (Carmine Wrath)&quot; reroll=hit1 reroll=wound1 kw=&quot;Character&quot; conditional</comment>
              <description>Friendly **^^Blood Angels Character^^** units:
■ Can re-roll hit rolls of 1.
■ Can re-roll wound rolls of 1.Restrictions: Your army can include **^^Blood Angels^^** units, but it cannot include any **^^Adeptus Astartes^^** units drawn from any other Chapter.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Focused Fury (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="39f0-281c-7f5a-1589" hidden="false">
              <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=fight
sim-mod: source=&quot;FOCUSED FURY&quot; lethal when=melee
sim-mod: source=&quot;FOCUSED FURY&quot; wound=+1 when=melee onCharge conditional</comment>
              <description>Angelic Inheritors – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Fight phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit is selected to fight.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit.
EFFECT: Your unit’s melee attacks:
■ Have [LETHAL HITS].
■ Or: If your unit is a CHARACTER unit, have [LETHAL HITS], [LANCE].</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="In the Shadow of Great Wings (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="364b-49aa-338f-b3ed" hidden="false">
              <comment>strat-timing: turn=opponent phase=shooting</comment>
              <description>Angelic Inheritors – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your opponent&apos;s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES CHARACTER unit.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS ASTARTES CHARACTER unit.
EFFECT: Your unit has:
■ Stealth.
■ -3&quot; detection range..</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Instant of Grace (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="77f8-0b7d-a254-ac96" hidden="false">
              <comment>strat-timing: turn=your phase=command</comment>
              <description>Angelic Inheritors – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Command phase.
TARGET: One friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES INFANTRY unit.
EFFECT: Your unit has CHARACTER until the start of your next Command phase.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Strike Now for Glory (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="ce72-1a87-a066-18ea" hidden="false">
              <comment>strat-timing: turn=your phase=shooting
sim-mod: source=&quot;STRIKE NOW FOR GLORY&quot; sustained=1 when=ranged</comment>
              <description>Angelic Inheritors – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Shooting phase when a friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit is selected to attack.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit.
EFFECT: Your unit’s ranged attacks have [SUSTAINED HITS 1].</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Unto the Burning Skies (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="20d5-979c-7b4d-ce80" hidden="false">
              <comment>strat-timing: turn=opponent phase=fight</comment>
              <description>Angelic Inheritors – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: End of your opponent’s Fight phase.
TARGET: One friendly THE SANGUINOR/unengaged ADEPTUS ASTARTES JUMP PACK unit.
EFFECT: Place your unit in strategic reserves.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Measured Strategist (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="a459-0878-b9e9-996f" hidden="false">
              <comment>strat-timing: turn=your phase=command</comment>
              <description>Angelic Inheritors – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Command phase.
TARGET: One friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES CHARACTER unit.
EFFECT: Select one combat doctrine. That combat doctrine is active for your unit until the start of your next Command phase.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Wrath of the Rock" hidden="false" id="9d23-833a-17cb-2d7d">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden">
