WHEN: Your Shooting phase when a KILL TEAM unit is selected to shoot.
TARGET: That KILL TEAM unit.
EFFECT: Your unit’s ranged attacks:
■ Can re-roll wound rolls of 1.
■ Have [IGNORES COVER].</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Hellfire Rounds (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="f3f6-1409-6d59-d3b6" hidden="false">
              <comment>strat-timing: turn=your phase=shooting</comment>
              <description>Deathwatch Support – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Shooting phase when a KILL TEAM unit is selected to shoot.
TARGET: That KILL TEAM unit.
EFFECT: Your unit’s ranged attacks (excluding [DEVASTATING WOUNDS] attacks) have [ANTI-non-VEHICLE 4+].</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
