              <description>Phobos Shock Force – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a move within 8&quot; of a friendly unengaged PHOBOS unit.
TARGET: That PHOBOS unit.
EFFECT: Your unit can make a normal move of:
■ Up to D6&quot;.
■ Or: If the tactical doctrine is active for your unit, up to 6&quot;.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Umbral Evasion (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="7fbd-9a56-3214-3a24" hidden="false">
              <comment>strat-timing: turn=opponent phase=shooting</comment>
              <description>Phobos Shock Force – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly PHOBOS unit.
TARGET: That PHOBOS unit.
EFFECT: Ranged attacks that target your unit have -1 to hit rolls.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
