          <rules>
            <rule name="Combined Deployment" id="cf8c-c118-df36-b6b5" hidden="false">
              <description>In your Shooting phase, when a friendly **^^Adeptus Astartes Transport^^** unit has shot, you can select one enemy unit hit by those attacks. That enemy unit is assailed until the end of the turn:
■ While a unit is assailed, when an **^^Adeptus Astartes^^** unit that disembarked this turn targets that unit, those attacks have **[SUSTAINED HITS 1]**.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Aggressive Disembarkation (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="f32c-13e9-46a1-b894" hidden="false">
              <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=any</comment>
              <description>Gauntlet Task Force – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Any phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit embarked within a TRANSPORT is selected to move.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit.
EFFECT: While making that move, each model in your unit can be set up within the set-up distance of that TRANSPORT.
This allows you to set up your unit within the set-up distance of your TRANSPORT, instead of wholly within that distance.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Duty is Never Done (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="3d7d-a111-11e2-e444" hidden="false">
              <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=fight</comment>
              <description>Gauntlet Task Force – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: End of the Fight phase.
TARGET: One friendly unengaged ADEPTUS ASTARTES INFANTRY unit that was eligible to fight this phase, is wholly within 6&quot; of a friendly TRANSPORT unit, and is eligible to embark within that TRANSPORT unit.
EFFECT: Your unit embarks within that TRANSPORT unit.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Storm and Secure (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="a798-0403-d1dd-92b9" hidden="false">
              <comment>strat-timing: turn=your phase=movement</comment>
              <description>Gauntlet Task Force – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: End of your Movement phase.
TARGET: One friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES TRANSPORT unit that has an ADEPTUS ASTARTES BATTLELINE unit embarked within it.
EFFECT: Select one objective your unit is controlling. That objective is secured.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
        </selectionEntry>
