        <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Ceramite Sentinels" hidden="false" id="2966-a72c-eeee-cfda">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden">
              <conditions>
                <condition type="notInstanceOf" value="1" field="selections" scope="primary-catalogue" childId="5d6e-fd3-330a-11dd" shared="true"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <costs>
            <cost name="DP" typeId="0d99-4ee2-7b3c-1f5a" value="2"/>
          </costs>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Adaptive Defence" id="44c9-9209-d108-6f63" hidden="false">
              <comment>sim-mod: source=&quot;Adaptive Defence&quot; reroll=wound1 conditional</comment>
              <description>■ While a friendly **^^Adeptus Astartes^^** unit is within a terrain area, that unit’s attacks can re-roll wound rolls of 1.
■ Friendly **^^Adeptus Astartes^^** units are entrenched while all of the following apply:
■ That unit is within a terrain area.
■ That unit was not set up this turn.
■ No model in that unit moved more than 3&quot; this turn.

■ Friendly **^^Darnath Lysander^^**/**^^Tor Garadon^^** units have the following ability:
**Defensive Mastery**: At the start of each phase, this unit is entrenched.

Darnath Lysander&apos;s/Tor Garadon&apos;s unit is always entrenched, regardless of the conditions listed above.

**Restrictions:** Your army can include **^^Imperial Fists^^** units, but it cannot include any **^^Adeptus Astartes^^** units drawn from any other Chapter.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Unyielding Might (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="d4e6-8cfe-3e49-09aa" hidden="false">
              <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=command</comment>
              <description>Ceramite Sentinels – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Command phase.
TARGET: One friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit that is within range of an objective.
EFFECT: Your unit has +1 OC until the end of the turn.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Stand to the End (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="a00b-b2a7-b12d-cdb7" hidden="false">
              <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=shooting|fight
def-mod: source=&quot;Stand to the End&quot; wound=-1 vsStronger conditional choice=&quot;Stand to the End&quot;
def-mod: source=&quot;Stand to the End (entrenched)&quot; wound=-1 conditional choice=&quot;Stand to the End&quot;</comment>
              <description>Ceramite Sentinels – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your opponent’s Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when an enemy unit targets a friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit (excluding MONSTER/VEHICLE units).
TARGET: That ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit.
EFFECT: 
■ Attacks that target your unit with a S greater than your unit’s T have -1 to wound rolls.
■ Or: If your unit is entrenched, attacks that target your unit have -1 to wound rolls.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Augmented Targeting (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="284e-eb35-570c-7ae8" hidden="false">
              <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=shooting|fight
sim-mod: source=&quot;Augmented Targeting&quot; lethal conditional choice=&quot;Augmented Targeting&quot;
sim-mod: source=&quot;Augmented Targeting&quot; sustained=1 conditional choice=&quot;Augmented Targeting&quot;
sim-mod: source=&quot;Augmented Targeting (entrenched)&quot; lethal sustained=1 conditional choice=&quot;Augmented Targeting&quot;</comment>
              <description>Ceramite Sentinels – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit is selected to attack.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit.
EFFECT: Your unit’s attacks have:
■ [LETHAL HITS].
■ Or: [SUSTAINED HITS 1].
■ Or: If your unit is entrenched, [LETHAL HITS] and [SUSTAINED HITS 1].</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Establish Supremacy (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="7445-d79c-68b3-5dd9" hidden="false">
              <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=fight</comment>
              <description>Ceramite Sentinels – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Fight phase, when a friendly entrenched ADEPTUS ASTARTES INFANTRY unit is selected to make a consolidation move.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS ASTARTES INFANTRY unit.
EFFECT: You can select the objective consolidation mode for that consolidation move, regardless of that consolidation move’s Before Moving restrictions.

Designer’s Note: This means your unit can move out of engagement range with enemy units, provided it meets the conditions of the objective consolidation mode.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Priority Strike (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="2246-8a64-89aa-19b1" hidden="false">
              <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=shooting|fight
sim-mod: source=&quot;Priority Strike&quot; wound=+1 vs=Monster,Vehicle kw=&quot;Infantry,Mounted&quot;</comment>
              <description>Ceramite Sentinels – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES INFANTRY/MOUNTED unit is selected to attack.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS ASTARTES INFANTRY/MOUNTED unit.
EFFECT: Your unit’s attacks that target a MONSTER/VEHICLE unit, have +1 to wound rolls.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Evasive Repositioning (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="9945-8f6f-4cf1-797e" hidden="false">
              <comment>strat-timing: turn=opponent phase=shooting</comment>
              <description>Ceramite Sentinels – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit has shot.
TARGET: One friendly unengaged ADEPTUS ASTARTES INFANTRY/MOUNTED unit that lost a wound as a result of those attacks.
EFFECT: 
■ Your unit can make a normal move of up to D6&quot;.
■ Or: If your unit is entrenched, your unit can make a normal move of up to D3+3&quot;.
Your unit is not able to embark within a TRANSPORT until the end of the turn.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
          <profiles>
            <profile name="Force Disposition" typeId="4680-63ad-ad70-1872" typeName="Force Disposition" hidden="false" id="35ab-90c0-770c-c8bd">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Force Disposition" typeId="9145-6e6a-17b9-0a2c">Take and Hold</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
        <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Medusa&apos;s Wrath" hidden="false" id="092e-c1cd-1a24-8def">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" value="true" field="hidden">
              <conditions>
                <condition type="notInstanceOf" value="1" field="selections" scope="primary-catalogue" childId="f27e-18c0-b73e-748e" shared="true"/>
              </conditions>
            </modifier>
          </modifiers>
          <costs>
            <cost name="DP" typeId="0d99-4ee2-7b3c-1f5a" value="2"/>
          </costs>
          <rules>
            <rule name="Armoured Wrath" id="7d86-e2c2-9f8a-94b2" hidden="false">
              <description>Each time a friendly **^^Adeptus Astartes^^** unit is selected to shoot or selected to fight apply one of the following when resolving those attacks:
■ If that unit is within 6&quot; of a friendly **^^Caanok Var^^**/**^^Iron Father Feirros^^** unit you can:
  ■ Re-roll one hit roll.
  ■ Re-roll one wound roll.
  ■ Re-roll one damage roll.
■ Otherwise you can:
■ Re-roll one hit roll.
■ Or: Re-roll one wound roll.
■ Or: Re-roll one damage roll.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Unbowed Conviction (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="b0bd-b80b-37a0-54a9" hidden="false">
              <comment>strat-timing: turn=your phase=command</comment>
              <description>Medusa&apos;s Wrath – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Command phase.
TARGET: One friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit that is below starting strength.
EFFECT: Until the start of your next Command phase, your unit can ignore modifiers to your unit’s:
■ BS and WS.
■ Hit rolls and Wound rolls.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Spirits of Iron (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="5cf9-a347-a034-89a2" hidden="false">
              <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=any
def-mod: source=&quot;Spirits of Iron&quot; fnp=5 mortal conditional</comment>
              <description>Medusa&apos;s Wrath – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Any phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit suffers a mortal wound.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit.
EFFECT: Your unit has Feel no pain 5+ against mortal wounds.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Vengeful Animus (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="c0cc-8520-575f-f2ec" hidden="false">
              <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=any</comment>
              <description>Medusa&apos;s Wrath – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Any phase, when a friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES VEHICLE unit is destroyed, before rolling for deadly demise.
TARGET: That friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES VEHICLE unit.
EFFECT: Change any deadly demise rolls made for this unit to an unmodified 6.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Methodical Brutality (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="5286-feaa-573e-a7db" hidden="false">
              <comment>strat-timing: turn=either phase=shooting|fight
sim-mod: source=&quot;Methodical Brutality&quot; sustained=1 conditional
sim-mod: source=&quot;Methodical Brutality (Vehicle)&quot; wound=+1 conditional kw=&quot;Vehicle&quot;</comment>
              <description>Medusa&apos;s Wrath – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Shooting phase or the Fight phase when a friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit is selected to attack.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit.
EFFECT: Your unit’s attacks have [SUSTAINED HITS 1].
+ If your unit is a VEHICLE unit, have +1 to wound rolls.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Ancient Fury (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="61e7-14c0-3c18-ce6c" hidden="false">
              <comment>strat-timing: turn=your phase=command
sim-mod: source=&quot;Ancient Fury&quot; hit=+1 conditional kw=&quot;Dreadnought&quot;</comment>
              <description>Medusa&apos;s Wrath – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your Command phase.
TARGET: One friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES DREADNOUGHT unit.
EFFECT: Until the start of your next Command phase, your unit has:
■ +1&quot; M.
■ +1 T.
■ +1 Ld.
■ +1 OC.
■ +1 to hit rolls.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule name="Power of the Machine Spirit (Stratagem, 1CP)" id="e3b2-7442-6a9c-b657" hidden="false">
              <comment>strat-timing: turn=opponent phase=shooting</comment>
              <description>Medusa&apos;s Wrath – STRATAGEM (1CP)

WHEN: Your opponent’s Shooting phase, when an enemy unit that targeted a friendly unengaged ADEPTUS ASTARTES VEHICLE unit has shot.
TARGET: That ADEPTUS ASTARTES VEHICLE unit.
EFFECT: Your unit shoots using:
■ Snap shooting.
■ Or: If your unit is at half-strength/below half-strength, normal shooting.
While doing so your unit can only target that enemy unit.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
          <profiles>
            <profile name="Force Disposition" typeId="4680-63ad-ad70-1872" typeName="Force Disposition" hidden="false" id="2910-0afa-ff2c-1628">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Force Disposition" typeId="9145-6e6a-17b9-0a2c">Purge the Foe</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <categoryLinks>
            <categoryLink id="51a1-c085-aa3e-506e" name="UNIQUE IRONSTORM" hidden="false" targetId="f6f0-dd7b-25de-9564" primary="false"/>
          </categoryLinks>
        </selectionEntry>
      </selectionEntries>
