                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">**^^Techmarine^^** model only.
(Once per battle round, per army) When an enemy unit targets a friendly **^^Adeptus Astartes Vehicle^^** unit within 6&quot; of this unit, you can use this ability. If you do, that **^^Vehicle^^** unit has Feel No Pain 5+ until that enemy unit has attacked.</characteristic>
